    "1.4.11.7.5730": "\u00a7b\u00a7lELECTRO'S POWERCRAFT\u00a7r\n\u00a7fVersion 1.4.11.7.5730 | Minecraft 1.20.1\u00a7r\n\u00a78--------------------------------\u00a7r\n\u00a7e\u00a7l[BETA]\u00a7r \u00a77[1.4.11.8 SNAPSHOT]\u00a7r\n\u00a77RELEASE DATE:\u00a7f July 25, 2026\u00a7r\n\u00a77UPDATE SERIES:\u00a7f The Realistic Update | 1.4.11.8 Snapshot\u00a7r\n\u00a78--------------------------------\u00a7r\n\n\u00a76\u00a7l! IMPORTANT COMPATIBILITY NOTICE\u00a7r\n\u00a7fVersions 1.4.11+ use mod ID electros_powercraft instead of electros_mod. Updating a world from 1.4.10.x or earlier can cause existing mod blocks and items to disappear. Back up the world before changing versions.\u00a7r\n\u00a7fStarter Pack notice: Version 1.4.11.4 changed starter-pack variables. Updating from 1.4.11.2 or earlier may replace items in affected inventory slots when the Starter Pack gamerule is enabled.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7a\u00a7l+ STABILITY UPDATE - AATST INTEGRATED-SERVER FREEZE FIXED\u00a7r\n\u00a7fThis Beta snapshot fixes the AATST integrated-server tick freeze observed with Cracker's Wither Storm. The AATST Applier was reworked to coordinate through the new AATST Queuer, with safer per-entity handling and client-side awareness. Players using an affected older snapshot should update to 1.4.11.7.5730 or later.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7b\u00a7l======== CHANGELOG ========\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7e\u00a7l> RELEASE STATUS AND REQUIREMENTS\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f At its July 25, 2026 release, this was designated the most stable 1.4.11.8 snapshot to date and recommended over earlier affected snapshots.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Forge 1.20.1: 47.2.0 or higher. Required: GeckoLib 4.4.2 or higher. Recommended: JEI 15.3.0.8 or higher.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7a\u00a7l> MAJOR BUG FIXES\u00a7r\n\u00a7a-\u00a7f Fixed the AATST integrated-server tick-freeze issue by redesigning applier/queuer coordination.\u00a7r\n\u00a7a-\u00a7f Fixed the Rock Salt custom loot-table drop error.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7b\u00a7l> WORLD GENERATION AND BLOCKS\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Expanded Rock Salt generation to Deep Ocean and Deep Lukewarm Ocean biomes and allowed Clay replacement.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Changed Rock Salt generation shape from Uniform to Triangle.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Increased Rock Salt generation averages from 5 to 7 per chunk and 8 to 10 per group.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Expanded Rock Salt generation height from Y 45-60 to Y 40-62 and adjusted its harvest-tool tier.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Adjusted Rain Collector's preferred tool for breaking.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated Y-axis rotation of Medical Cabinet, Rain Collector, and Elemental Block; adjusted Medical Cabinet block faces.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7b\u00a7l> ENCHANTMENTS AND STATUS EFFECTS\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Made Nether Heatness Immunity inapplicable to Netherite Armor and changed its rarity from Rare to Uncommon.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Expanded Awake Elapsed System (ALS) with Fatigue Level 3 and localized Fatigue Levels 2/3 alerts.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Sleeping now subtracts 1 day and 8 hours from the Awake Elapsed System (ALS), previously 1 day; improved time subtraction and day handling.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a79\u00a7l> COMMANDS AND FEEDBACK\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Enhanced ALS get/set/reset command messages with formatting, pluralization, and revised wording.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Refined Special Book set/get/reset command messages and syntax for Book of Inspiration, Restless, Physician, and Hearty.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added decimal-value validation, smarter override checks, formatted messages, and literal reset parameters for Special Book commands.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added an advanced smart spawn-position checker to the /RW zombified-entity easy wave.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Improved /RW success and failure messages for difficulty, monster caps, and cooldowns.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7b\u00a7l> LOCALIZATION AND QUALITY OF LIFE\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Improved gamerule names/descriptions for Starter Items Pack, Spawn Champions, Biome Temperatures, Player Elemental Invulnerability, Player Thirst Bar, Natural Water Source Penalties, and Medicine Apply Delay.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated Glacial, Freezing Cold, Cold, Hot, Very Hot, Scorching Hot, Scalding Hot, and Boiling Hot temperature-alert localization.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Polished descriptions for many advancements covering elemental crafting, weapons, upgrades, exploration, champions, medicine, and collections.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated advancement recipe rewards for First Fire Element and Ice Upgrade II.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated Electro's PowerCraft description/credits and added Spider Bite subtitle localization.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a79\u00a7l> TECHNICAL IMPROVEMENTS\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added the AATST Queuer procedure; made AATST Applier and Queuer client-side aware with safer per-entity coordination.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated Awake Elapsed System time subtraction and feedback handling.\u00a7r",
    "1.4.11.7.5080": "\u00a7b\u00a7lELECTRO'S POWERCRAFT\u00a7r\n\u00a7fVersion 1.4.11.7.5080 | Minecraft 1.20.1\u00a7r\n\u00a78--------------------------------\u00a7r\n\u00a7c\u00a7l[ALPHA]\u00a7r \u00a77[1.4.11.8 SNAPSHOT]\u00a7r\n\u00a77RELEASE DATE:\u00a7f June 23, 2026\u00a7r\n\u00a77UPDATE SERIES:\u00a7f The Realistic Update | 1.4.11.8 Snapshot\u00a7r\n\u00a78--------------------------------\u00a7r\n\n\u00a76\u00a7l! IMPORTANT COMPATIBILITY NOTICE\u00a7r\n\u00a7fVersions 1.4.11+ use mod ID electros_powercraft instead of electros_mod. Updating a world from 1.4.10.x or earlier can cause existing mod blocks and items to disappear. Back up the world before changing versions.\u00a7r\n\u00a7fStarter Pack notice: Version 1.4.11.4 changed starter-pack variables. Updating from 1.4.11.2 or earlier may replace items in affected inventory slots when the Starter Pack gamerule is enabled.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7c\u00a7l! KNOWN ISSUE - FIXED IN 1.4.11.7.5730\u00a7r\n\u00a7fThis older Alpha snapshot can experience an integrated-server tick freeze when used with Cracker's Wither Storm. The issue was traced to the AATST system and fixed in 1.4.11.7.5730 by reworking per-entity coordination between the AATST Applier and the new AATST Queuer, with client-side awareness. Update to 1.4.11.7.5730 or later for this fix.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7b\u00a7l======== CHANGELOG ========\u00a7r\n\n\u00a76\u00a7l> HIGHLIGHTS\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added an expanded Confusion effect with special potions, twisted mushrooms, and custom behavior for players and mobs.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added the First Aid Kit, placeable guide/special books, and improved Knife attacks.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated Elemental Army mob classes, AI, natural spawning, and integration with the Elemental Enforcement Addon.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Made falling-related leg penalties less severe.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7a\u00a7l> MAJOR BUG FIXES\u00a7r\n\u00a7a-\u00a7f Fixed the Freezing Status Effect attribute system.\u00a7r\n\u00a7a-\u00a7f Fixed Powered Electric Soldier PSCT/Powered Sword Countdown Timer behavior and health conditions for charged attacks.\u00a7r\n\u00a7a-\u00a7f Fixed some nighttime spawn-brightness checks and Elemental Enforcement Addon mod-ID/targeter conditions.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7b\u00a7l> ITEMS, POTIONS, RECIPES, AND PLANTS\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added First Aid Kit, including use procedures and Medical Villager trade availability.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added Potion of Confusion, Prolonged Confusion, Compulsive Confusion, Charged Confusion, and Charged Prolonged Confusion, with recipes.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added Twisted Mushroom Plant and Charged Twisted Mushroom Plant, including generation and particle effects.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Enabled Electro's Guide, Melee Training Book, and Special Books to be placed on bookshelves via book tags.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated Knife texture, description, and bleeding attack behavior.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated Cotton Plant texture and adjusted the hunger effect from eating Infected Spider Eye.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated Medical Villager trades: Herbal Antibiotics quantity 3 to 5 and Antibiotics quantity 10 to 7.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7b\u00a7l> CONFUSION GAMEPLAY\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added the Confusion status effect and description.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added player inverted movement controls, random hand/head movement, and Confused question-mark particles.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added Confusion behavior for entities that may target nearby mobs, including their own species; added random panic wandering and no-target outcomes.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added Confusion Level II random target selection, proximity swings, and cooldown logic.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added special confused-Skeleton behavior: shaking, wobbling, sidesteps, panic dashes, health scaling, and limited self-attacks.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added confused-Creeper behaviors involving false ignition, short panic fuses, rare explosions, and associated particles.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added Confusion self-attack/panic-swing damage types and death messages.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Prevented some confusion targeting behavior when Unnoticeable is active.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added player movement keybinds and supporting pressed/released handlers for forward, backward, left, and right.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7b\u00a7l> PARTICLES AND KNIFE COMBAT\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added Blood Drop, Confused (Question Mark), and Small/Medium Gentle Spore Drift particles.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated Knife attacks with advanced random effect chances, Bleed Resistance detection, blood-drop positioning, spawn-rate timing, and element tags.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added Knife-attack immunity conditions for Cracker's Wither Storm mobs.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added bleeding-particle worker procedures for players and entities.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a79\u00a7l> FREEZING, MEDICAL, AND FALLING SYSTEMS\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated Freezing applied/expiry logic, replaced FEGT tracking with FMAW logic, and made freezing prevent sprinting.\u00a7r\n\u00a7c-\u00a7f Removed the extra Slowness effect from Ice Element Attacks.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated BLFA fall-injury distances for Sprained Leg, Splinted Leg, and Broken Leg; added Goat immunity.\u00a7r\n\u00a7a-\u00a7f Corrected Herobrine Level 30's reinforcement notification.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7d\u00a7l> ELEMENTAL ARMY AND AI\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Changed Electric/Ice Soldiers Levels 1-2, Ice Ranged Soldiers Levels 1-2, Powered Electric Soldier Level 3, Electro Levels 1/5/10, and Ice Level 1 to Neutral Mob classes with advanced spawning conditions.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Changed Electric and Ice Soldier Level 1 trainers to Pathfinder Mob classes.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Adjusted movement speeds for Electro, Ice, and selected Soldiers; reduced Electro Level 1/5/10 attributes.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Increased Ice Ranged Soldier Level 1/2 arrow attack delays.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Integrated Elemental Enforcement Addon anger-retaliation conditions across supported units; added ranged-retaliation safeguards and corrected targeter overrides for ranged soldiers.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated mob tags (including Zombie, Undead, Skeleton, Boss, and elemental unit tags) and confusion damage localization.\u00a7r",
    "1.4.11.7.3590": "\u00a7b\u00a7lELECTRO'S POWERCRAFT\u00a7r\n\u00a7fVersion 1.4.11.7.3590 | Minecraft 1.20.1\u00a7r\n\u00a78--------------------------------\u00a7r\n\u00a7c\u00a7l[ALPHA]\u00a7r \u00a77[1.4.11.8 SNAPSHOT]\u00a7r\n\u00a77RELEASE DATE:\u00a7f July 25, 2025\u00a7r\n\u00a77UPDATE SERIES:\u00a7f The Realistic Update | 1.4.11.8 Snapshot\u00a7r\n\u00a78--------------------------------\u00a7r\n\n\u00a76\u00a7l! IMPORTANT COMPATIBILITY NOTICE\u00a7r\n\u00a7fVersions 1.4.11+ use mod ID electros_powercraft instead of electros_mod. Updating a world from 1.4.10.x or earlier can cause existing mod blocks and items to disappear. Back up the world before changing versions.\u00a7r\n\u00a7fStarter Pack notice: Version 1.4.11.4 changed starter-pack variables. Updating from 1.4.11.2 or earlier may replace items in affected inventory slots when the Starter Pack gamerule is enabled.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7c\u00a7l! HISTORICAL STABILITY NOTICE - FIX AVAILABLE\u00a7r\n\u00a7fThe original notes for this older Alpha snapshot warned of loading or server issues in heavily modded worlds. A later investigation identified an AATST integrated-server tick freeze observed with Cracker's Wither Storm. That specific issue was fixed in 1.4.11.7.5730 through safer AATST Applier/Queuer coordination. For this fix, update to 1.4.11.7.5730 or later; other historical stability reports may have different causes.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7b\u00a7l======== CHANGELOG ========\u00a7r\n\n\u00a76\u00a7l> HIGHLIGHTS\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Reintroduced the Rain Collector with water-collection mechanics and JEI integration.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added Book of Hearty and the revamped 'Restful Vibes' music.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7a\u00a7l> BUG FIXES\u00a7r\n\u00a7a-\u00a7f Fixed the Rain Collector.\u00a7r\n\u00a7a-\u00a7f Corrected Berserk attack behavior for Ice Ranged Soldier Level 2.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7b\u00a7l> BLOCKS, ITEMS, AND RECIPES\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Readded the Rain Collector block.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added Book of Hearty (Special Book), Water Collector Grate, and Copper Rain Gatherer.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added recipes for Rain Collector, Water Collector Grate, and Copper Rain Gatherer.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated the Sewing Kit recipe to use an Iron Nugget instead of an Iron Ingot.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added Rain Collector-related recipe unlockers.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7d\u00a7l> RAIN COLLECTOR AND JEI\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Enabled Rain Collector automatic ticking and NBT-based water storage, including maxWaterValue.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added water-delivery procedures, GUI input/output slots, and Rain Gatherer modification support.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added Rain Collector JEI recipe GUI, filtered-water recipes, and JEI information.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated the Filtered Water Bottle texture.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7b\u00a7l> SPECIAL BOOKS, STATUS EFFECTS, AND GAMEPLAY\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added Book of Hearty GUI, skill-level logic, health application, and set/get/reset Special Book commands.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Integrated Book of Hearty into starter respawn effects and Reset-All Special Book commands.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Increased Bowl of Rice water replenishment from 0.5 to 1.5.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Lowered hunger depletion from Mild, Active, and Advanced Decay.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added Fury potency scaling to hunger drain and improved Berserk damage/source targeting.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Disabled shaking for Zombified Electric Soldier Level 4.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated Medical Villager trade multipliers for Sewing Kit and Splint.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated Radiated Flesh after-use effects and Food Poisoning localization.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7d\u00a7l> MUSIC AND LANGUAGES\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added ElectroGaming10 - Restful Vibes - Remake, replacing the older track in Survival Autoplay Music.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated Japanese, German, Filipino, Chinese (Taiwan), Spanish (Mexico/Spain), and French.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added English (Canada) translation support.\u00a7r",
    "1.4.11.7.3000": "\u00a7b\u00a7lELECTRO'S POWERCRAFT\u00a7r\n\u00a7fVersion 1.4.11.7.3000 | Minecraft 1.20.1\u00a7r\n\u00a78--------------------------------\u00a7r\n\u00a7c\u00a7l[ALPHA]\u00a7r \u00a77[1.4.11.8 SNAPSHOT]\u00a7r\n\u00a77RELEASE DATE:\u00a7f March 14, 2025\u00a7r\n\u00a77UPDATE SERIES:\u00a7f The Realistic Update | 1.4.11.8 Snapshot\u00a7r\n\u00a78--------------------------------\u00a7r\n\n\u00a76\u00a7l! IMPORTANT COMPATIBILITY NOTICE\u00a7r\n\u00a7fVersions 1.4.11+ use mod ID electros_powercraft instead of electros_mod. Updating a world from 1.4.10.x or earlier can cause existing mod blocks and items to disappear. Back up the world before changing versions.\u00a7r\n\u00a7fStarter Pack notice: Version 1.4.11.4 changed starter-pack variables. Updating from 1.4.11.2 or earlier may replace items in affected inventory slots when the Starter Pack gamerule is enabled.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7c\u00a7l! HISTORICAL STABILITY NOTICE - FIX AVAILABLE\u00a7r\n\u00a7fThe original notes for this older Alpha snapshot warned of loading or server issues in heavily modded worlds. A later investigation identified an AATST integrated-server tick freeze observed with Cracker's Wither Storm. That specific issue was fixed in 1.4.11.7.5730 through safer AATST Applier/Queuer coordination. For this fix, update to 1.4.11.7.5730 or later; other historical stability reports may have different causes.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7b\u00a7l======== CHANGELOG ========\u00a7r\n\n\u00a76\u00a7l> HIGHLIGHTS\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Improved effect descriptions across a wide range of medical and gameplay status effects.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Expanded player HUD and localization support.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7b\u00a7l> STATUS EFFECTS AND MEDICAL ITEMS\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Revised descriptions for Broken Leg, Sprained Leg, Splinted Leg, Concussion, Deep Laceration, Abrasion, and Treated Abrasion.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Revised descriptions for Inspiration, Quenched, Mild/Active/Advanced Decay, Bleeding, Shocked, Unnoticeable, and Freezing.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Set the Medicine Delay effect classification to neutral.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Improved Splinted Leg application notifications.\u00a7r\n\u00a7a-\u00a7f Fixed First Aid Bandage application in Creative Mode.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f First Aid Bandage now applies Treated Abrasion only when Abrasion is present.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7b\u00a7l> HUD AND TEXT\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added Absorption HUD support through PBER player procedures, including the IceGamer1159/Arata PBER system entry.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added the Food Poisoning localization key for the Radiated Flesh after-use behavior.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7b\u00a7l> LANGUAGES\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated Japanese, Chinese (Taiwan), Filipino (Philippines), Spanish (Mexico), Spanish (Spain), French (France), and German (Germany).\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7e\u00a7l> DEVELOPMENT NOTE\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f The original public changelog states that some additional changes were kept hidden; this entry does not speculate about those changes.\u00a7r",
    "1.4.11.7.2610": "\u00a7b\u00a7lELECTRO'S POWERCRAFT\u00a7r\n\u00a7fVersion 1.4.11.7.2610 | Minecraft 1.20.1\u00a7r\n\u00a78--------------------------------\u00a7r\n\u00a7c\u00a7l[ALPHA]\u00a7r \u00a77[1.4.11.8 SNAPSHOT]\u00a7r\n\u00a77RELEASE DATE:\u00a7f March 8, 2025\u00a7r\n\u00a77UPDATE SERIES:\u00a7f The Realistic Update | 1.4.11.8 Snapshot\u00a7r\n\u00a78--------------------------------\u00a7r\n\n\u00a76\u00a7l! IMPORTANT COMPATIBILITY NOTICE\u00a7r\n\u00a7fVersions 1.4.11+ use mod ID electros_powercraft instead of electros_mod. Updating a world from 1.4.10.x or earlier can cause existing mod blocks and items to disappear. Back up the world before changing versions.\u00a7r\n\u00a7fStarter Pack notice: Version 1.4.11.4 changed starter-pack variables. Updating from 1.4.11.2 or earlier may replace items in affected inventory slots when the Starter Pack gamerule is enabled.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7c\u00a7l! HISTORICAL STABILITY NOTICE - FIX AVAILABLE\u00a7r\n\u00a7fThe original notes for this older Alpha snapshot warned of loading or server issues in heavily modded worlds. A later investigation identified an AATST integrated-server tick freeze observed with Cracker's Wither Storm. That specific issue was fixed in 1.4.11.7.5730 through safer AATST Applier/Queuer coordination. For this fix, update to 1.4.11.7.5730 or later; other historical stability reports may have different causes.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7b\u00a7l======== CHANGELOG ========\u00a7r\n\n\u00a76\u00a7l> HIGHLIGHTS\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added the Book of Physician, Bleed Resistance, and Treated Abrasion.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Expanded first-aid interactions and redesigned the player Bossbar/HUD behavior.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7a\u00a7l> BUG FIXES\u00a7r\n\u00a7a-\u00a7f Fixed the Zombified Creeper's Unnoticeable-entity fuse behavior.\u00a7r\n\u00a7a-\u00a7f Fixed Honey Bottle's interaction with the Medicine Apply Delay gamerule.\u00a7r\n\u00a7a-\u00a7f Fixed the player-punch Hit SFX.\u00a7r\n\u00a7a-\u00a7f Fixed the Dead HUD behavior in PBER.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7b\u00a7l> ITEMS, BOOKS, AND STATUS EFFECTS\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added Book of Physician (Special Book), its GUI, skill system, and Special Book command support.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added Bleed Resistance and Treated Abrasion status effects and Bleed Resistance description.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added Bleed Resistance handling to Band-Aid, First Aid Bandage, and Sewing Kit.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated Deep Laceration to detect Bleed Resistance; revised effect icon and application notices.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Splint now interacts with the Book of Physician system, can cure Sprained Leg, and heals Broken Leg faster when applied.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added Treated Abrasion application through First Aid Bandage and additional Abrasion detectors/attack handling.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated Bleeding and Splinted Leg status classifications, the Bleeding overlay position, and Concussion Resistance description.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7b\u00a7l> PLAYER HUD AND GAMEPLAY\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Improved Bossbar Executable, including entity targeting, per-player Bossbars, automatic hiding, and HUD color.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added PBER (player Bossbar) procedures, Absorption HUD, and an absorption scoreboard runner.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Adjusted Fatigue effect damage and infection-particle placement for players.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added food replenishment for Jellies and excluded them from the food drainer.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added Zombified Creeper avoidance behavior for Cats and Ocelots, Zombified Skeleton avoidance for Wolves, and a Wolf targeter for Zombified Skeleton.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Refined Reinforcement Wave zombified-entity command logic and Melee Training Book battle procedures.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added Book of Physician to Librarian trades and lowered Book of Inspiration's emerald price.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a79\u00a7l> TECHNICAL CHANGES\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Expanded MADG variables and join, leave, sleep, respawn, and command checkers.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added TBCD variable/counter and TADA, TAET, and TAEL variable systems.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Integrated TAET/TAEL with NCEG and EVC systems.\u00a7r",
    "1.4.11.7.2000": "\u00a7b\u00a7lELECTRO'S POWERCRAFT\u00a7r\n\u00a7fVersion 1.4.11.7.2000 | Minecraft 1.20.1\u00a7r\n\u00a78--------------------------------\u00a7r\n\u00a7c\u00a7l[ALPHA]\u00a7r \u00a77[1.4.11.8 SNAPSHOT]\u00a7r\n\u00a77RELEASE DATE:\u00a7f January 17, 2025\u00a7r\n\u00a77UPDATE SERIES:\u00a7f The Realistic Update | 1.4.11.8 Snapshot\u00a7r\n\u00a78--------------------------------\u00a7r\n\n\u00a76\u00a7l! IMPORTANT COMPATIBILITY NOTICE\u00a7r\n\u00a7fVersions 1.4.11+ use mod ID electros_powercraft instead of electros_mod. Updating a world from 1.4.10.x or earlier can cause existing mod blocks and items to disappear. Back up the world before changing versions.\u00a7r\n\u00a7fStarter Pack notice: Version 1.4.11.4 changed starter-pack variables. Updating from 1.4.11.2 or earlier may replace items in affected inventory slots when the Starter Pack gamerule is enabled.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7c\u00a7l! HISTORICAL STABILITY NOTICE - FIX AVAILABLE\u00a7r\n\u00a7fThe original notes for this older Alpha snapshot warned of loading or server issues in heavily modded worlds. A later investigation identified an AATST integrated-server tick freeze observed with Cracker's Wither Storm. That specific issue was fixed in 1.4.11.7.5730 through safer AATST Applier/Queuer coordination. For this fix, update to 1.4.11.7.5730 or later; other historical stability reports may have different causes.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7b\u00a7l======== CHANGELOG ========\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7e\u00a7l> RELEASE CONTEXT\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f This build includes the features from 1.4.11.7.1890, such as Baked Apple, HUD improvements, the Effect Attribute Giver fix, and combat balancing.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f The list below focuses on additions and changes specific to 1.4.11.7.2000.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7d\u00a7l> GAMEPLAY AND ENTITIES\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added Apple Pie to food replenishment and the food-drainer exclusion list.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Expanded the Attack Sickened Mobs system to trainers.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Adjusted Zombified Skeleton ranged-attack timing.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated the Elemental Hunter advancement to include infected monster parts.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7b\u00a7l> VISUALS AND UI\u00a7r\n\u00a7c-\u00a7f Removed glow textures from Electric Swords I-III, Electric Pickaxe I, Ice Swords I-II, and Jackson's Axe I.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Modified Bossbar Executable.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated the Fruits tag to include Baked Apple.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a79\u00a7l> MEDICINE AND TECHNICAL SYSTEMS\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Integrated the MADG variable into Herbal Antibiotics, Antibiotics, and Painkillers.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added the MADG Variable System and MADG Counter.\u00a7r",
    "1.4.11.7.1890": "\u00a7b\u00a7lELECTRO'S POWERCRAFT\u00a7r\n\u00a7fVersion 1.4.11.7.1890 | Minecraft 1.20.1\u00a7r\n\u00a78--------------------------------\u00a7r\n\u00a7c\u00a7l[ALPHA]\u00a7r \u00a77[1.4.11.8 SNAPSHOT]\u00a7r\n\u00a77RELEASE DATE:\u00a7f January 12, 2025\u00a7r\n\u00a77UPDATE SERIES:\u00a7f The Realistic Update | 1.4.11.8 Snapshot\u00a7r\n\u00a78--------------------------------\u00a7r\n\n\u00a76\u00a7l! IMPORTANT COMPATIBILITY NOTICE\u00a7r\n\u00a7fVersions 1.4.11+ use mod ID electros_powercraft instead of electros_mod. Updating a world from 1.4.10.x or earlier can cause existing mod blocks and items to disappear. Back up the world before changing versions.\u00a7r\n\u00a7fStarter Pack notice: Version 1.4.11.4 changed starter-pack variables. Updating from 1.4.11.2 or earlier may replace items in affected inventory slots when the Starter Pack gamerule is enabled.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7b\u00a7l======== CHANGELOG ========\u00a7r\n\n\u00a76\u00a7l> HIGHLIGHTS\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added Baked Apple and its smelting recipe.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Expanded Bossbar HUD conditions and modified Electro's PowerCraft client music configuration.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Rebalanced several melee weapons and refined status effects.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7a\u00a7l> MAJOR BUG FIX\u00a7r\n\u00a7a-\u00a7f Fixed the Effect Attribute Giver system.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7b\u00a7l> FOOD AND RECIPES\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added Baked Apple and the Baked Apple smelting recipe/unlocker.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added Baked Apple to the food replenisher, food-drainer exclusions, and Fruits tag.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7b\u00a7l> HUD AND INTERFACES\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Improved Bossbar displays for Bleeding, death, low health, non-full health, reduced health, and extended health.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added player-detection visibility handling to Bossbar Executable.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Improved localization for Element Invulnerability, Sewing Kit application errors, and Sprained Leg descriptions.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7b\u00a7l> GAMEPLAY AND ENTITY BALANCE\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added sickened-mob detection to the Zombie Attack system.\u00a7r\n\u00a7c-\u00a7f Removed Crimson Forest spawning for Powerful Creeper Levels I and II.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Expanded BLFA immunities for Magma Cubes, Slimes, and Frogs and lowered its penalty timer.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added Netherite Armor immunity to the Boiling Hot effect; adjusted Boiling Hot and NHTD timer behavior.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added a not-riding check to the Thirst Bar condition.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Reduced efficiency/attack speed for Electric Swords I-III and efficiency for Jackson's Axe I.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Adjusted Zombified Skeleton ranged-attack arrows.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added FADA logic to Fatigue; Fatigue can now reduce maximum health.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a79\u00a7l> MUSIC AND TECHNICAL CHANGES\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added EPC Client Configuration music checks to Electro's Melee Training Book and Herobrine Reinforcement playback.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated the Jackson's Axe element tag and Effect Attribute Giver.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added the FADA Variable System.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7e\u00a7l> VERSION NOTE\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f At the time, this version was recommended for modpacks experiencing problems with 1.4.11.7.2000. The subsequently identified AATST integrated-server tick freeze was fixed in 1.4.11.7.5730; use that version or later when addressing that issue.\u00a7r",
    "1.4.11.7.1620": "\u00a7b\u00a7lELECTRO'S POWERCRAFT\u00a7r\n\u00a7fVersion 1.4.11.7.1620 | Minecraft 1.20.1\u00a7r\n\u00a78--------------------------------\u00a7r\n\u00a7c\u00a7l[ALPHA]\u00a7r \u00a77[1.4.11.8 SNAPSHOT]\u00a7r\n\u00a77RELEASE DATE:\u00a7f January 9, 2025\u00a7r\n\u00a77UPDATE SERIES:\u00a7f The Realistic Update | 1.4.11.8 Snapshot\u00a7r\n\u00a78--------------------------------\u00a7r\n\n\u00a76\u00a7l! IMPORTANT COMPATIBILITY NOTICE\u00a7r\n\u00a7fVersions 1.4.11+ use mod ID electros_powercraft instead of electros_mod. Updating a world from 1.4.10.x or earlier can cause existing mod blocks and items to disappear. Back up the world before changing versions.\u00a7r\n\u00a7fStarter Pack notice: Version 1.4.11.4 changed starter-pack variables. Updating from 1.4.11.2 or earlier may replace items in affected inventory slots when the Starter Pack gamerule is enabled.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7b\u00a7l======== CHANGELOG ========\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7a\u00a7l> MAJOR BUG FIX\u00a7r\n\u00a7a-\u00a7f Fixed the Concussion Attribute Giver system's attack-damage handling.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7d\u00a7l> ZOMBIE INFECTION AND ENTITIES\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added or adjusted infection particles and display names for affected players and Mild Decay entities.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated player infection blacklists for zombified entities and zombie-tagged mobs.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Adjusted Ice Soldier infection particles and Jackson Zombiez Level 1 AI.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated Zombified Skeleton Level 2 entity base and AI tasks.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Expanded monster-in-range (MIR) detection and added an Attack Sickened Mobs system.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7b\u00a7l> STATUS EFFECTS AND GAMEPLAY\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated Medicine Delay interactions with Concussion Resistance and Concussion's attack-damage attribute handling.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added Cat immunity to the BLFA system.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Integrated SPLDA and SPLSS variables with Splinted Leg, SLSS with Sprained Leg, and BLSS with Broken Leg.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Revised armor-driven temperature changes in the TBH Temperature Controller.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Changed the Bleeding effect color and adjusted spawning difficulty scaling.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a79\u00a7l> TECHNICAL CHANGES\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added MIR Detector and variable logic.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added AATST variable, counter, and applier systems.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added element tags for Jackson's Axe, Electric Pickaxe, Electric Sword III, Jackson entities, and Electric Soldier Levels 1 and 2.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated the Electric Soldier Level 1 tag to include its trainer.\u00a7r",
    "1.4.11.7.1420": "\u00a7b\u00a7lELECTRO'S POWERCRAFT\u00a7r\n\u00a7fVersion 1.4.11.7.1420 | Minecraft 1.20.1\u00a7r\n\u00a78--------------------------------\u00a7r\n\u00a7c\u00a7l[ALPHA]\u00a7r \u00a77[1.4.11.8 SNAPSHOT]\u00a7r\n\u00a77RELEASE DATE:\u00a7f December 25, 2024\u00a7r\n\u00a77UPDATE SERIES:\u00a7f The Realistic Update | 1.4.11.8 Snapshot\u00a7r\n\u00a78--------------------------------\u00a7r\n\n\u00a76\u00a7l! IMPORTANT COMPATIBILITY NOTICE\u00a7r\n\u00a7fVersions 1.4.11+ use mod ID electros_powercraft instead of electros_mod. Updating a world from 1.4.10.x or earlier can cause existing mod blocks and items to disappear. Back up the world before changing versions.\u00a7r\n\u00a7fStarter Pack notice: Version 1.4.11.4 changed starter-pack variables. Updating from 1.4.11.2 or earlier may replace items in affected inventory slots when the Starter Pack gamerule is enabled.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7b\u00a7l======== CHANGELOG ========\u00a7r\n\n\u00a76\u00a7l> HIGHLIGHTS\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Introduced the Electro's PowerCraft Client Configuration System.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added /SB (Special Book) and /RW (Reinforcement Wave) commands.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Expanded the Zombie Infection system with new infection particles, sounds, targets, and immunity rules.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a79\u00a7l> COMMANDS AND CONFIGURATION\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added Special Book commands to set, get, and reset Book of Inspiration and Book of Restless levels; added a reset-all option.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added the Reinforcement Wave command, initially supporting an easy wave of zombified entities.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Improved Reinforcement Wave behavior with cooldown (RWCD), difficulty detection, ECD integration, and spread-out spawning.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added a client option to control playback of the Electro's PowerCraft soundtrack (Play_EPCOST), connected to ambient, startup, and survival music routines.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added a Play_OOST option for other soundtracks; the original notes mark this option as not yet functional.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7b\u00a7l> ZOMBIE INFECTION AND DECAY\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added the Infection particle and expanded its use with animals, vanilla mobs, players, Electro, Electric Soldiers, Powered Electric Soldiers, and Ice Soldiers.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added infection sounds for multiple Electro, Electric Soldier, Powered Electric Soldier, and Ice Soldier variants.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added zombie-infection scripts for Ice Soldier Level 1 and its trainer; expanded vanilla infection support to Villagers.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added Piglin, Skeleton, Spider, and Creeper handling in the Mild Decay infection system.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Expanded Mild, Active, and Advanced Decay immunity rules for Zombified Skeleton, Spider, Creeper, undead entities, and zombie-tagged mobs.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Improved player infection display names and player infection handling through SIPC and its resetter system.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7b\u00a7l> GAMEPLAY AND BALANCE\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Sewing Kit now cures Bleeding.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Adjusted the Zombified Creeper explosion range.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Lowered the emerald cost of elemental swords in Elemental Villager trades.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Electric Source, Electric Power, Energetic Electric Power, and Thunder Power are no longer fire-resistant; adjusted their item-destruction properties.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added the ADR (Attribute Detection Remover) to Freezing, Broken Leg, and Sprained Leg effects.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Improved Inspiration regeneration at level I and added level II regeneration.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated Zombified Powered Electric Soldier targeting to include Ice.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7b\u00a7l> OTHER MODIFICATIONS\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated Hit SFX, including the Spider Bite sound category.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated several electric and ice item file names.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated Medic advancement text, Wendigo loot, and Herobrine levels 15, 30, and 45.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added elemental source/power tags for electric, ice, and fire items.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7a\u00a7l> BUG FIXES\u00a7r\n\u00a7a-\u00a7f Fixed excessive Zombified Human spawning when a player was killed by Mild Decay.\u00a7r",
    "1.4.11.7.800": "\u00a7b\u00a7lELECTRO'S POWERCRAFT\u00a7r\n\u00a7fVersion 1.4.11.7.800 | Minecraft 1.20.1\u00a7r\n\u00a78--------------------------------\u00a7r\n\u00a7c\u00a7l[ALPHA]\u00a7r \u00a77[1.4.11.8 SNAPSHOT]\u00a7r\n\u00a77RELEASE DATE:\u00a7f December 20, 2024\u00a7r\n\u00a77UPDATE SERIES:\u00a7f The Realistic Update | 1.4.11.8 Snapshot\u00a7r\n\u00a78--------------------------------\u00a7r\n\n\u00a76\u00a7l! IMPORTANT COMPATIBILITY NOTICE\u00a7r\n\u00a7fVersions 1.4.11+ use mod ID electros_powercraft instead of electros_mod. Updating a world from 1.4.10.x or earlier can cause existing mod blocks and items to disappear. Back up the world before changing versions.\u00a7r\n\u00a7fStarter Pack notice: Version 1.4.11.4 changed starter-pack variables. Updating from 1.4.11.2 or earlier may replace items in affected inventory slots when the Starter Pack gamerule is enabled.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7b\u00a7l======== CHANGELOG ========\u00a7r\n\n\u00a76\u00a7l> HIGHLIGHTS\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Introduced Zombified Skeleton, Zombified Spider, and Zombified Creeper.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Expanded cooking, ingredients, crops, monster drops, and status-effect descriptions.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added glowing textures to radiated and zombified monsters.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7d\u00a7l> NEW ENTITIES AND COMBAT\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added Zombified Skeleton, Zombified Spider, and Zombified Creeper.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added conditional glow rendering for Zombified Spider and Zombified Creeper, including an exploding appearance for the Creeper.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added a Zombified Creeper explosion system, an explosion display condition, and synchronized CTF variable/counter logic.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated the Zombified Skeleton renderer and Zombified Creeper explosion behavior and display.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated targeting for Electro, Powered Electric Soldier, Electric Soldiers, Ice Soldiers, and Wendigo Stage 1.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Expanded Zombie Infection handling for Electro variants, Electric and Ice units, animals, and vanilla mobs.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated immunity handling for new zombified entities, including Instant Death immunity and monster-immunity logic.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7b\u00a7l> BLOCKS, PLANTS, FOOD, AND ITEMS\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added Rock Salt Block, its loot table, and the Salt ingredient.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added Black Pepper Plant, Peppercorn, and Black Pepper, including plant loot and a Black Pepper recipe.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added Raw Squid, Cooked Squid, Rotten Mutton, and Rotten Porkchop.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added Salami, Cooked Salami, and Mozzarella Cheese.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added Knife and Bowl of Fruit Salad.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added Infected Bone, Infected Spider Eye, and Infected Gunpowder as monster drops/ingredients.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added loot drops for Zombified Skeleton, Zombified Spider, Zombified Creeper, Zombified Sheep, and Zombified Pig.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7b\u00a7l> RECIPES AND RECIPE UNLOCKS\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added cooked Squid and cooked Salami smelting recipes and unlockers.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added Mozzarella Cheese, Salami, Knife, Black Pepper, and Fruit Salad recipes and unlockers.\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added ingredient tags for fruits, sweeteners, flowers, and zombies.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7b\u00a7l> FOOD, THIRST, AND STATUS EFFECTS\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added written descriptions for status effects.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated food replenishment and draining for Beetroot, Glow Berries, Squid, Chorus Fruit, and Mozzarella Cheese.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Integrated ETD into PTB food/drink replenishment and draining, including fruit, crop, and vegetable handling.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Adjusted Sushi food properties and the Infected Spider Eye's eating behavior.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated Fuse status effect behavior with respect to mob griefing.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a79\u00a7l> VISUALS, MUSIC, AND SYSTEMS\u00a7r\n\u00a7b-\u00a7f Added a glow texture for Radiated Zombie and new glow/explosion visuals for zombified mobs.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Updated ambient and automatic music playback and the Bossbar Executable system.\u00a7r\n\u00a77-\u00a7f Adjusted Restrict Sun Burn and monster targeting systems.\u00a7r\n\n\u00a7a\u00a7l> BUG FIXES\u00a7r\n\u00a7a-\u00a7f Fixed the Mild Decay exhaustion applier.\u00a7r\n\u00a7a-\u00a7f Fixed the Fatigue exhaustion applier.\u00a7r",
